# PRESENTATION DECKS ARE NEVER UPLOADED. Ruled 2026-09-20. These arrive by hand for review, carry
# internal material, and are large enough (the All Hands deck is 60 MB) that a single `git add -A`
# would write one into history on both remotes permanently. Ignored by extension rather than by
# path, because the next one will have a different name.
*.pptx
*.ppt

# internal working drafts (agent prompts, plans, unpublished post drafts) - never commit
docs/_working/
.gate-failures/
.efficacy.lock/
